WEBVTT

00:07.705 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS.

01:46.465 --> 01:47.945
Please think about it.

01:48.025 --> 01:50.665
I already agreed to pay in full.
I can't keep giving in.

01:50.745 --> 01:51.945
3.98 million.

01:52.025 --> 01:54.185
Not a penny more.

01:55.945 --> 01:57.745
Okay, take care, sir.

02:04.505 --> 02:05.545
It's just a ten-grand difference.

02:05.625 --> 02:07.905
Why don't you cave a little, Xu?

02:08.665 --> 02:10.785
The landlord's whole family
came to talk to you.

02:10.864 --> 02:12.185
That shows pretty good faith.

02:12.265 --> 02:13.385
I can give it a shot

02:13.465 --> 02:14.865
and try to get them down
to 4.05 million for you.

02:15.625 --> 02:17.985
This landlord's too greedy.

02:18.065 --> 02:20.905
The second he heard I'd pay in full,
he jacked up the price.

02:20.985 --> 02:23.425
Bet you if I agreed, he'd raise it again.

02:23.945 --> 02:26.065
Anyway, he backed out
of the online signing.

02:26.145 --> 02:27.425
Just freeze him out for a few days.

02:28.465 --> 02:32.625
I do negotiations all the time.
I know how sellers think.

02:32.705 --> 02:34.785
But his son keeps telling him not to sell.

02:34.865 --> 02:36.745
He says apartment prices
have dropped way too much these years,

02:36.825 --> 02:38.705
so he wants to wait
for them to bounce back.

02:39.225 --> 02:40.985
It's a rare opportunity, Xu.

02:41.945 --> 02:44.625
Your boyfriend seems pretty generous.

02:44.705 --> 02:47.345
It's exactly because of it that I can't
throw money around like I'm rich.

02:47.945 --> 02:49.985
Zhu, I'll leave it to you
these next few days.

02:50.065 --> 02:52.545
Please call him more
and help me push the price down.

02:52.625 --> 02:53.745
Let me know if anything comes up, okay?

02:53.825 --> 02:56.105
-Alright.
-Thank you. I'm leaving.

03:00.585 --> 03:02.545
Benyuan, Yuanzhou, and several
other digital collectible platforms

03:02.625 --> 03:03.905
have blown up one after another.

03:03.985 --> 03:06.465
According to stats,
over 300 police reports have been filed.

03:07.305 --> 03:09.065
Public security authorities
are taking the matter seriously

03:09.145 --> 03:10.985
and have launched
an official investigation.

03:11.065 --> 03:12.745
MULTIPLE DIGITAL COLLECTIBLES PLATFORMS
SUSPECTED OF RUG PULLS

03:12.825 --> 03:13.945
ART INDEX PLUNGES 10%

03:17.145 --> 03:18.865
Hey, I saw the news.

03:18.945 --> 03:20.585
Is this you guys closing the net?

03:21.625 --> 03:23.985
No. Just a coincidence.

03:25.225 --> 03:27.945
It's actually months ahead
of what Du and I had planned.

03:28.025 --> 03:31.105
But with Wen Ruosen
expanding at full throttle like this,

03:31.625 --> 03:33.025
security problems
were only a matter of time.

03:34.145 --> 03:37.145
Then the whole plan has to move up.

03:37.825 --> 03:38.705
Can I help with anything?

03:39.465 --> 03:40.465
No need.

03:40.985 --> 03:42.705
You have enough to deal with
between your project

03:42.785 --> 03:44.105
and the apartment.

03:48.665 --> 03:50.585
Hold on. I'm getting a call.
Don't hang up.

03:53.185 --> 03:54.505
Hey, Tianna, what's up?

03:58.065 --> 03:59.945
Yeah, yeah. Well,

04:00.545 --> 04:02.425
I'll get it done and send it to you now.

04:08.025 --> 04:09.105
Tianna called.

04:09.185 --> 04:12.265
I need to finish revising a file
and send it to her before takeoff.

04:12.345 --> 04:14.545
I was up all night haggling
with the landlord, so I forgot about it.

04:14.625 --> 04:15.865
Go do your thing. Bye.

04:16.465 --> 04:17.305
Okay.

04:17.905 --> 04:19.624
Wait, Chi.

04:19.705 --> 04:22.505
Let me say one more thing.
Don't push yourself so hard.

04:22.585 --> 04:23.425
I'm a little worried about you.

04:24.145 --> 04:25.545
I know. I'm fine.

04:26.065 --> 04:27.945
You've got to give me a chance
to learn from you.

04:28.025 --> 04:29.985
You're way busier than I am. Don't worry.

04:30.065 --> 04:31.185
Okay.

04:31.265 --> 04:33.265
Anyway, take care of yourself.

04:33.865 --> 04:35.985
Message me when you land in Shenzhen.

04:36.825 --> 04:37.665
Okay.

04:53.745 --> 04:56.465
What's so urgent that you had
to come to me at this hour?

04:57.865 --> 04:58.865
I'm sick.

04:59.745 --> 05:01.425
Just spit it out and get going.

05:01.505 --> 05:02.825
I've got a really serious illness.

05:03.625 --> 05:04.665
Have a seat.

05:04.745 --> 05:07.185
Let me walk you through my condition.

05:19.105 --> 05:20.945
You want to know
what those bald patches look like?

05:24.385 --> 05:25.745
That was me two years ago.

05:25.825 --> 05:27.105
The company was broke back then.

05:27.905 --> 05:29.105
I was barely holding on.

05:29.185 --> 05:30.545
I was pitching VCs every day.

05:32.105 --> 05:34.145
One day, on my way to meet a VC associate,

05:34.225 --> 05:35.785
I noticed I'd gotten bald patches.

05:36.505 --> 05:37.345
At seven in the morning,

05:37.425 --> 05:39.745
I went door to door at hair salons,

05:39.825 --> 05:41.385
begging them to shave my head.

05:42.865 --> 05:44.505
What does this have to do
with your illness?

05:44.585 --> 05:45.945
Let me finish.

05:49.865 --> 05:50.745
OUTPATIENT RECORD

05:50.825 --> 05:51.865
This is my diagnosis report.

05:53.185 --> 05:54.745
I've got a really severe stomach ulcer.

05:55.985 --> 05:57.185
My stomach's a mess.

05:57.265 --> 06:00.305
I wish I could lock myself
in the bathroom 24/7

06:00.825 --> 06:01.745
and be stuck at home for days.

06:06.345 --> 06:07.625
This is my ID,

06:07.705 --> 06:09.225
my household register, and my diploma.

06:12.545 --> 06:13.385
This is my family.

06:16.145 --> 06:18.025
My parents divorced when I was little.

06:18.105 --> 06:19.705
My dad ran off with someone else.

06:20.225 --> 06:22.785
And I never had a great relationship
with my stepdad.

06:27.025 --> 06:28.585
These are my two best friends.

06:28.665 --> 06:29.705
My ride-or-dies.

06:30.785 --> 06:31.825
And…

06:34.145 --> 06:35.185
lastly,

06:36.025 --> 06:37.625
I want to introduce you

06:38.665 --> 06:39.905
to my favorite, Sun Wukong.

06:40.905 --> 06:42.305
Since third grade,

06:42.385 --> 06:43.585
I've taken him everywhere I go.

06:48.625 --> 06:49.785
I'm done.

06:55.105 --> 06:57.545
I've listened to all this,
and I still don't get it.

06:57.625 --> 06:59.985
What does any of this have to do with me?

07:01.705 --> 07:03.065
Of course it does.

07:03.745 --> 07:04.945
You wouldn't accept me

07:05.545 --> 07:07.505
because you wanted to keep your dignity.

07:07.585 --> 07:08.425
I finally figured it out.

07:09.625 --> 07:11.945
It's just because when we first met,

07:12.025 --> 07:13.225
your work wasn't going well.

07:14.505 --> 07:16.225
Every day you were either
dealing with your divorce

07:16.305 --> 07:17.505
or running to the hospital.

07:17.585 --> 07:20.065
You showed me all your worst moments.

07:20.665 --> 07:22.345
So it made you feel really awkward.

07:22.865 --> 07:25.465
Now I've shown you
the realest version of me.

07:25.545 --> 07:27.265
And I'm telling you,
I've got plenty of mess too.

07:27.345 --> 07:28.185
Now we're even.

07:29.385 --> 07:32.785
I'm really not as glamorous as you think.

07:32.865 --> 07:34.865
I've had my ugly, pathetic moments too.

07:34.945 --> 07:37.345
Every morning I woke up
to a mountain of mess.

07:38.465 --> 07:39.905
Let me be straight with you.

07:40.505 --> 07:41.825
Because of Bolo,

07:41.905 --> 07:43.985
my apartment's
still mortgaged to the bank.

07:44.585 --> 07:47.425
If one day Bolo blows up
like those digital collectible platforms,

07:47.505 --> 07:48.465
I might not even

07:48.545 --> 07:50.185
have money for a hair transplant.

07:54.945 --> 07:56.385
I'm telling you all this

07:57.505 --> 07:59.145
because I want you to know…

08:04.745 --> 08:05.585
I really like you.

08:08.305 --> 08:09.785
I used to like

08:10.905 --> 08:12.905
the tough act you put on.

08:13.985 --> 08:15.185
Now I like the you who,

08:15.265 --> 08:17.785
even after being knocked down
a thousand times,

08:17.865 --> 08:21.585
still gets back up
and tries to live a beautiful life.

08:29.345 --> 08:30.425
Can you give me a chance?

08:31.025 --> 08:32.545
And give yourself one too?

08:33.385 --> 08:35.985
You bring your lipstick,
and I'll bring my toys.

08:36.065 --> 08:38.585
Let's have some drinks
and get some hot pot.

08:38.664 --> 08:41.585
Let's go on a nice trip.
That's better than anything.

08:41.664 --> 08:42.904
Stop.

08:49.305 --> 08:50.145
Okay.

08:51.705 --> 08:52.545
I won't say anything.

08:56.345 --> 08:57.185
I'll show you.

09:42.585 --> 09:43.905
-Morning.
-Morning.

09:56.145 --> 09:57.305
MESSAGE

09:59.305 --> 10:00.705
FIRST TIME I'M ACTUALLY THANKFUL
FOR MY MOTHER SETTING UP THAT BLIND DATE

10:02.105 --> 10:04.345
Who even sends MMS these days.

10:05.705 --> 10:08.745
First time I'm actually thankful
for my mother setting up that blind date.

10:08.825 --> 10:11.625
Beautiful Tianna, nice to meet you.

10:13.705 --> 10:14.785
Blind date?

10:39.825 --> 10:41.985
What's wrong with you?
You've been acting weird all morning.

10:43.705 --> 10:44.545
Didn't sleep well last night.

10:45.785 --> 10:48.345
Stop lying. You've never
treated me like this before.

10:50.105 --> 10:51.385
It's really nothing.

10:52.905 --> 10:54.105
You're really pushing it now?

10:54.185 --> 10:55.625
Tell me what's going on right now
or we're breaking up.

11:01.185 --> 11:02.145
Fine.

11:04.825 --> 11:05.665
Were we ever even together?

11:11.465 --> 11:12.425
Then how can we break up?

11:27.025 --> 11:27.865
What's wrong with you?

11:34.785 --> 11:35.745
FIRST TIME I'M ACTUALLY THANKFUL
FOR MY MOTHER SETTING UP THAT BLIND DATE

11:35.825 --> 11:36.665
BEAUTIFUL TIANNA, NICE TO MEET YOU

11:42.265 --> 11:44.305
Let me explain. Here's the thing.

11:44.385 --> 11:46.345
I did have a meal with Shen Jin.

11:46.425 --> 11:48.945
And I did joke around
with him a bit about Lin.

11:49.025 --> 11:50.465
-And then…
-Were you two on a date?

11:51.465 --> 11:52.345
Are you interrogating me?

11:53.225 --> 11:54.265
You know

11:54.345 --> 11:56.625
my family has certain
social obligations we can't avoid.

11:56.705 --> 11:57.985
Don't be like this, okay?

11:58.065 --> 11:59.905
Something just occurred to me.

11:59.985 --> 12:01.425
I've got two good friends.

12:02.185 --> 12:03.345
Both total characters.

12:03.945 --> 12:05.825
One's a scheming guy.

12:06.625 --> 12:09.065
He knows his girlfriend
is going on blind dates,

12:09.145 --> 12:12.385
and he still acts like nothing's wrong
and treats her all sweet.

12:12.465 --> 12:14.065
He took advantage of her guilt,

12:14.145 --> 12:15.905
slept with her,
got her pregnant, married her,

12:15.985 --> 12:17.385
and called it a win.

12:18.985 --> 12:21.265
My other friend is pretty average.

12:21.345 --> 12:24.225
He takes things personally.
He gets upset, he gets angry,

12:24.825 --> 12:25.745
and he starts wondering

12:25.825 --> 12:27.945
what kind of relationship
he and his girlfriend actually have

12:28.025 --> 12:30.305
when, after all this time,
she still won't acknowledge him

12:30.385 --> 12:32.345
in front of her colleagues and friends.

12:32.425 --> 12:33.505
She even

12:34.025 --> 12:36.505
thinks going on blind dates
is just normal socializing.

12:37.105 --> 12:38.825
Aren't my two friends interesting?

12:38.905 --> 12:41.505
If you were me, which one would you pick?

12:46.705 --> 12:48.065
They're definitely interesting.

12:48.665 --> 12:49.545
Right?

12:51.425 --> 12:52.345
So you want to fight?

12:55.305 --> 12:56.585
Then let me ask you,

12:57.425 --> 12:59.265
isn't Xu Chi our friend?

12:59.345 --> 13:00.785
Doesn't she know about us?

13:00.865 --> 13:03.225
-And Ye Xinzhi also--
-I really don't wanna fight.

13:03.985 --> 13:05.345
I just want you to tell me

13:05.425 --> 13:06.945
which of these two versions

13:07.865 --> 13:09.065
of Zhao Heng you prefer.

13:15.945 --> 13:16.785
You--

13:35.905 --> 13:38.625
Shen Jin, tell me straight.
What are you getting at?

13:38.705 --> 13:39.985
Hold on.

13:40.065 --> 13:41.705
You'll be thanking me later.

13:43.185 --> 13:44.665
BU TIANNA, MAXMISE

13:44.745 --> 13:45.985
Hello?

14:15.905 --> 14:18.665
-Wen Ruosen's had a tough run lately.
-What happened?

14:18.745 --> 14:20.865
He's about to face criminal charges.

14:20.945 --> 14:22.825
-Really?
-Yeah. Look.

14:23.625 --> 14:26.065
After getting sued, he got dragged

14:26.145 --> 14:27.265
into a bunch of platform blowups?

14:27.345 --> 14:28.545
Yeah. On top of that,

14:28.625 --> 14:31.065
buyers are flocking
to his gallery to protest,

14:31.145 --> 14:33.785
claiming he and the platforms
ran a rat trading scheme.

14:35.825 --> 14:37.585
Excuse me. Can I borrow
your phone for a sec?

14:39.785 --> 14:40.745
Thanks.

14:48.225 --> 14:49.065
Thanks.

15:02.185 --> 15:04.185
Xinzhi, it's me. The Yuanzhou thing…

15:04.265 --> 15:05.945
Yeah, this time it was us.

15:06.025 --> 15:07.465
Du's team was monitoring public opinion

15:07.545 --> 15:09.505
and saw people
going to the gallery to protest,

15:09.585 --> 15:10.905
so they pushed a few trending topics.

15:12.865 --> 15:14.265
I was just about to tell you.

15:14.345 --> 15:16.625
I sat in on a local CBIRC meeting
this morning.

15:16.705 --> 15:18.785
A bank mentioned
they're pulling loans from several

15:18.865 --> 15:20.225
collectible companies
with bad reputations.

15:20.305 --> 15:21.745
Yuanzhou is one of them.

15:22.345 --> 15:24.305
Got it. With this intel,

15:24.385 --> 15:27.305
I can go tip off
Wen Ruosen's lending bank in Beijing.

15:29.585 --> 15:31.785
So? Officer Rabbit's
pretty impressive, huh?

15:31.865 --> 15:33.105
Impressive.

15:33.185 --> 15:35.145
When I got handcuffed, I was terrified.

15:36.305 --> 15:38.105
You're a bad guy. Talk to you later.

15:38.185 --> 15:39.745
I have to work a bit more.

15:40.785 --> 15:42.865
-Let's meet when I'm back.
-By the way,

15:43.425 --> 15:45.305
how do you get to sit in
on finance sector meetings?

15:45.385 --> 15:46.505
You went to Celestial again?

15:47.785 --> 15:50.625
I had no choice.
The project's wrapping up.

15:50.705 --> 15:53.065
Final delivery's next week.

15:53.585 --> 15:55.265
So I'm just going nonstop.

15:56.225 --> 15:58.865
I've only slept about six hours
these past two days.

15:59.385 --> 16:01.785
In half an hour, I'm heading
to the airport to fly to Chengdu.

16:02.385 --> 16:04.145
It's really satisfying, though.

16:04.225 --> 16:06.385
I've been on the road
and already finished deliveries

16:06.465 --> 16:07.385
for two branch offices.

16:08.185 --> 16:09.825
But Tianna

16:09.905 --> 16:11.185
is not having a great day.

16:12.385 --> 16:14.865
A file she delivered got rejected
by Celestial again.

16:14.945 --> 16:16.825
She's putting on a brave face,

16:16.905 --> 16:18.265
but I know she's crushed inside.

16:19.065 --> 16:20.105
Send me your location.

16:20.185 --> 16:21.065
Why?

16:21.145 --> 16:23.185
The sly old fox
wants to treat his little rabbit

16:23.265 --> 16:24.345
to a luxury ride,

16:24.425 --> 16:26.185
complete with a zero-gravity seat

16:26.265 --> 16:27.825
for some real sleep. Is that okay?

16:34.065 --> 16:35.225
Thank you.

16:37.825 --> 16:39.665
Mr. Ye wanted me
to buy these as fast as possible.

16:39.745 --> 16:41.905
Good thing there's a flower shop
right by me.

16:42.425 --> 16:43.425
Miss Xu, please.

16:48.745 --> 16:50.105
And this hot chocolate.

16:50.185 --> 16:52.225
Mr. Ye said you have to drink it.

16:53.185 --> 16:54.025
Thanks.

16:55.465 --> 16:56.945
But this is such a waste.

16:57.025 --> 16:59.025
I can't take it on the plane.

16:59.705 --> 17:01.225
That just makes Mr. Ye even more romantic.

17:01.305 --> 17:02.745
Even if it's only half an hour of joy,

17:02.825 --> 17:04.385
he wants you to have it.

17:21.985 --> 17:23.345
Got it.

17:23.424 --> 17:25.424
I'll confirm that with them later.

17:27.105 --> 17:27.944
Okay.

17:34.545 --> 17:35.585
WECHAT

17:35.665 --> 17:38.585
Xu, are you there? Urgent. Please reply.

17:38.665 --> 17:39.945
Xu, are you there?

17:40.025 --> 17:42.025
-Xu?
-Did the landlord agree?

17:42.745 --> 17:44.465
Okay. Let me note that down.

17:47.105 --> 17:48.625
Ms. Xu, you finally got back to me.

17:48.705 --> 17:50.865
No word from the landlord yet,
but there's something else urgent.

17:50.945 --> 17:53.585
I can't say it over WeChat.
Can we talk on the phone right now?

17:54.745 --> 17:56.265
Not a good time. I'm busy.
I'll hit you back later.

17:57.785 --> 17:59.745
I'm listening, Mr. Zheng. Please go ahead.

17:59.825 --> 18:00.585
MR. ZHENG

18:00.665 --> 18:01.505
ZHU, AGENT

18:04.865 --> 18:08.225
Sorry. Is it the whole company
or the whole department?

18:13.785 --> 18:15.185
I told you I'm busy.

18:15.265 --> 18:17.265
Xu, don't hang up yet. Something happened.

18:17.345 --> 18:18.625
Zhu, I really don't have time right now.

18:18.705 --> 18:20.425
Call me when the landlord
agrees, okay? Bye.

18:21.145 --> 18:23.785
Sorry, Mr. Zheng.
I just got a call. Please continue.

19:01.105 --> 19:03.785
According to the management
of Celestial's Jiangxi branch…

19:04.305 --> 19:06.665
-Jiangxi?
-What's going on?

19:10.705 --> 19:11.705
CELESTIAL INSURANCE JIANGSU BRANCH

19:12.385 --> 19:14.985
Sorry. Jiangsu.

19:15.505 --> 19:17.065
I… I've been on the road
these past few days.

19:17.145 --> 19:18.785
I'm losing all sense of time and place.

19:18.865 --> 19:19.905
Sorry.

19:20.465 --> 19:22.385
Now let me walk you
through the restructuring

19:22.465 --> 19:23.665
of the intelligent underwriting system.

19:25.305 --> 19:27.185
Ma'am, please fasten your seatbelt.

19:28.745 --> 19:30.705
Sir, please stow your tray table.

19:30.785 --> 19:32.505
Sir, please open the window shade.

19:33.025 --> 19:34.825
Ma'am, the seat back needs to be upright.

19:35.745 --> 19:37.225
Ma'am, the tray table needs to be stowed.

19:58.345 --> 20:01.305
Xu, it's on the news. Now I can tell you.

20:01.825 --> 20:03.265
Your old apartment is Number 92.

20:03.345 --> 20:04.785
Experts have deemed it unsafe to live in.

20:04.865 --> 20:06.905
They're evacuating residents right now.

20:11.305 --> 20:12.145
ILLEGAL BASEMENT DIGGING
IN YONG'AN ROAD COURTYARD NO. 91

20:12.225 --> 20:13.065
CAUSES INDOOR COLLAPSE

20:13.585 --> 20:16.665
SINKHOLE SUDDENLY OPENS
IN RESIDENTIAL AREA

20:16.745 --> 20:17.585
SEVERAL BUILDINGS LEFT CRACKED

20:21.985 --> 20:23.145
Ladies and gentlemen,

20:23.225 --> 20:25.545
the plane is descending
through cloud cover.

20:25.625 --> 20:27.865
There'll be some turbulence.
Please don't worry.

20:36.265 --> 20:37.105
A HOME IN YONG'AN ROAD COURTYARD
NO. 91 COLLAPSED

20:37.185 --> 20:38.905
ILLEGAL BASEMENT CONSTRUCTION
CAUSING RIVER WATER TO FLOOD IN

20:38.985 --> 20:39.825
A 30-METER SINKHOLE APPEARED

20:39.905 --> 20:40.745
AFFECTING TEN NEARBY BUILDINGS

20:49.945 --> 20:51.425
XU CHI

20:52.945 --> 20:56.265
Sorry. The number you have dialed
is powered off.

21:03.785 --> 21:04.625
CA7622 16:35 LANDING

21:05.385 --> 21:07.385
XU CHI

21:13.145 --> 21:15.185
Chen. Skip the venue.

21:15.265 --> 21:16.705
Take me to Yong'an Road No. 92.

21:22.425 --> 21:24.265
Something came up. I can't make it.

21:24.345 --> 21:28.465
YE XINZHI

21:32.145 --> 21:33.145
-Hello?
-What's going on?

21:33.225 --> 21:34.825
A room full of people
are waiting for you, man.

21:34.905 --> 21:37.625
Du, can you run it for me?

21:37.705 --> 21:38.745
Something came up on my end.

21:38.825 --> 21:42.025
Plus, you know media and PR
better than I do.

21:42.105 --> 21:43.625
What are you even saying, man?

21:43.705 --> 21:45.385
This was your thing from the start.

21:46.025 --> 21:47.785
We finally got Yuanzhou to blow up.

21:47.865 --> 21:50.065
I got the best people in the business
to help you stir up public opinion.

21:50.145 --> 21:51.625
And now you're not coming?

21:51.705 --> 21:53.865
So who's gonna call the shots
on the messaging?

21:53.945 --> 21:55.825
Who's gonna handle
the strategy going forward?

21:55.905 --> 21:57.785
I've pretty much drafted
the whole strategy and plan.

21:57.865 --> 21:58.705
I'll email it to you in a bit.

21:58.785 --> 21:59.945
Don't bother! I'm not reading it!

22:00.025 --> 22:01.385
Don't get so worked up.

22:01.465 --> 22:02.625
What's so earth-shattering

22:02.705 --> 22:04.465
that you'd bail on me right now?

22:04.545 --> 22:05.385
By…

22:08.585 --> 22:11.145
Is… Is something wrong with Xu Chi?

22:12.185 --> 22:13.505
Something happened
with the apartment she's buying.

22:14.545 --> 22:17.345
What does her apartment
have to do with you?

22:17.425 --> 22:20.025
Man, don't you hate Wen Ruosen?

22:20.105 --> 22:21.065
Haven't you been dreaming of making

22:21.145 --> 22:22.785
him pay for what he did
to Jingshang's victims?

22:22.865 --> 22:24.025
How could you let

22:24.105 --> 22:26.305
some girl's apartment problem…

22:26.385 --> 22:29.105
How could you let some tiny little thing
ruin everything after getting this far?

22:29.185 --> 22:30.065
Du.

22:30.585 --> 22:32.225
Our plan against Wen Ruosen

22:32.305 --> 22:34.025
has been in the works for years.

22:34.785 --> 22:37.145
Even if there's a little hiccup
with the media rollout,

22:37.225 --> 22:38.505
it won't change the big picture.

22:38.585 --> 22:40.385
I'm trusting you with this.

22:40.465 --> 22:41.945
Just tell them I suddenly got sick
or missed my flight.

22:42.025 --> 22:42.865
Do me this solid, okay?

22:43.945 --> 22:45.225
Is she really that important?

22:45.305 --> 22:48.865
More important than the revenge
you've waited years for?

22:50.265 --> 22:51.105
Yes.

22:52.385 --> 22:54.225
Because my hatred for Wen Ruosen
is in the past.

22:54.305 --> 22:55.545
But she

22:56.625 --> 22:57.665
is my future.

22:59.345 --> 23:00.185
HAZARDOUS WORK IN PROGRESS
AUTHORIZED PERSONNEL ONLY

23:00.945 --> 23:02.945
‎-Everyone, please calm down.
‎-My stuff is still in there!

23:03.025 --> 23:05.025
‎-Everything is under inspection now.
‎-Please let us in.

23:05.105 --> 23:07.225
‎-Please move back a little.
‎-What are we supposed to do?

23:07.305 --> 23:10.385
‎-Please step back. Don't push.
‎-Let us in!

23:11.145 --> 23:13.705
‎We will come up with a solution.
‎Everyone, please stay calm.

23:14.505 --> 23:17.305
‎Please step back for safety.
‎It's very dangerous.

23:17.385 --> 23:19.625
‎Why is everything being taken away?

23:19.705 --> 23:20.705
‎Stop pushing!

23:20.785 --> 23:22.265
‎Don't crowd.

23:22.345 --> 23:23.985
‎Step back a little.

23:29.665 --> 23:30.625
Chi.

23:31.505 --> 23:32.425
What's wrong?

23:33.305 --> 23:35.625
Chi? Chi?

23:36.585 --> 23:37.585
Chi, are you okay?

23:38.625 --> 23:40.945
Chi, there are too many people here.

23:41.465 --> 23:42.465
Let's go home, alright?

23:45.505 --> 23:46.825
Let's go home, alright?

23:49.745 --> 23:51.105
What did you say?

23:52.225 --> 23:53.185
I can't hear you.

23:54.745 --> 23:55.585
You can't hear?

23:56.305 --> 23:59.265
What's wrong? Chi!

24:02.585 --> 24:03.545
Chi!

24:04.185 --> 24:05.185
Chi!

24:08.265 --> 24:09.705
How did the meeting go?

24:10.945 --> 24:13.225
Don't worry. I've got no objections.

24:14.265 --> 24:15.545
I'll be there next time for sure.

24:16.505 --> 24:18.265
How's your little girl doing?

24:19.465 --> 24:21.905
She just got the IV.
Still hasn't come around.

24:22.985 --> 24:24.665
She's awake, but she's still not stable.

24:24.745 --> 24:26.185
-Come take a look.
-Hang on a sec!

24:26.265 --> 24:28.425
Have you seen my laptop?

24:29.225 --> 24:30.265
-My laptop…
-You're awake.

24:30.785 --> 24:32.345
You've got barotrauma of the ear.

24:32.425 --> 24:33.625
The doctor said they've treated you.

24:33.705 --> 24:36.265
-What did you say? I can't hear you.
-She still can't hear?

24:36.345 --> 24:37.625
-No, we still need to monitor her.
-What's wrong with me?

24:38.265 --> 24:39.825
What's wrong with my ears? I can't hear!

24:40.505 --> 24:42.385
-Am I okay?
-You're fine.

24:51.025 --> 24:52.585
YOU'VE GOT EAR BAROTRAUMA
THE DOCTOR SAID THEY'VE TREATED YOU

24:52.665 --> 24:54.225
BUT YOU NEED TO REST
I'M HERE. DON'T BE SCARED

24:59.905 --> 25:01.225
I'm fine. I'm not scared.

25:01.985 --> 25:04.465
I'm healthy. I'll definitely be fine
after some sleep.

25:04.545 --> 25:05.625
Yeah, yeah.

25:05.705 --> 25:08.505
Where's my laptop?
It's got the files I just revised.

25:08.585 --> 25:10.385
-It's here.
-I need to go to the office tomorrow.

25:10.465 --> 25:12.145
-Yeah, yeah.
-Let me go back, okay?

25:12.225 --> 25:13.905
Don't be scared. Just rest.

25:13.985 --> 25:14.865
I'll stay with you. Listen to me, alright?

25:20.505 --> 25:22.985
I AM HERE WITH YOU

25:25.785 --> 25:27.345
I AM HERE

25:29.985 --> 25:32.265
ALRIGHT?

26:43.425 --> 26:48.065
EMERGENCY ROOM

27:01.945 --> 27:02.785
I'll stay with you.

27:05.825 --> 27:07.145
Sleep.

27:50.865 --> 27:52.825
BAROTRAUMA OF THE EAR

27:55.465 --> 27:57.305
BAROTRAUMATIC OTITIS MEDIA

27:59.065 --> 28:00.665
EUSTACHIAN TUBE DYSFUNCTION
RAPID EXTERNAL PRESSURE CHANGES

28:05.265 --> 28:06.785
Scumbag.

28:07.305 --> 28:08.865
Scum… Scumbag.

28:13.185 --> 28:16.665
I've got nothing left!

28:16.745 --> 28:18.425
You've got me.

28:19.305 --> 28:22.505
Chi, I've got nothing left.

29:25.145 --> 29:27.665
Now I can't hear, just like you.

29:28.905 --> 29:30.145
Let it all out. Cry.

29:30.665 --> 29:31.945
I'm right here.

31:28.905 --> 31:29.945
See that?

31:30.785 --> 31:32.545
You were awesome just now.

31:32.625 --> 31:33.905
Right?

31:40.665 --> 31:41.905
You know why I'm so accurate?

31:42.425 --> 31:43.425
Why?

31:44.745 --> 31:46.465
Is bowling good for this too?

31:47.305 --> 31:49.425
You know why I'm good at bowling?

31:49.505 --> 31:50.785
Why?

31:51.505 --> 31:52.665
Feel it.

31:54.425 --> 31:55.745
I've felt it before.

31:59.745 --> 32:01.785
We're out having fun.

32:02.385 --> 32:03.585
I'm not out having fun.

32:03.665 --> 32:05.665
I'm here for work.
You insisted on tagging along.

32:05.745 --> 32:08.345
I moved my conference call to noon

32:08.425 --> 32:11.305
just so I'd have an excuse
to sneak out and see you.

32:11.905 --> 32:13.705
We just got together.

32:13.785 --> 32:15.585
There's gotta be
some romance to it, right?

32:15.665 --> 32:16.945
If you ask me,

32:17.025 --> 32:18.905
why don't you just quit Maxmise?

32:18.985 --> 32:19.825
Join my company.

32:23.705 --> 32:25.385
Shen Jin, I thought

32:25.465 --> 32:26.585
you were different from my ex-husband.

32:27.865 --> 32:30.225
Come on. I was just saying it
off the top of my head.

32:30.305 --> 32:32.785
You know how strong Bolo is.

32:33.305 --> 32:35.025
I just don't want you working so hard.

32:35.785 --> 32:39.105
But I don't like people
planning out my life. Okay?

32:41.985 --> 32:42.905
Sure.

32:44.705 --> 32:45.705
Sure.

33:14.385 --> 33:15.425
Xinzhi!

33:16.465 --> 33:17.585
Xinzhi, where's my laptop bag?

33:17.665 --> 33:18.825
-I need to go to the office.
-Forget the laptop.

33:18.905 --> 33:20.185
I asked Sha Sha for the day off for you.

33:20.865 --> 33:23.345
No. I've got a meeting at 9:10.

33:24.905 --> 33:26.105
You can hear now?

33:30.545 --> 33:32.305
She still has some ringing
and fullness in her ears.

33:32.985 --> 33:34.145
But she can communicate fine.

33:35.905 --> 33:36.945
37.9 degrees Celsius.

33:39.785 --> 33:41.585
It's good to be young. Recovers so fast.

33:42.105 --> 33:43.465
Alright, Dr. Liu. Don't worry.

33:43.545 --> 33:45.345
I'll bring her over
for her IV this afternoon.

33:48.385 --> 33:49.505
No work.

33:49.585 --> 33:52.105
I'm fine now.
This meeting's really important.

33:52.185 --> 33:55.505
Dr. Liu said normal turbulence
wouldn't cause barotrauma.

33:55.585 --> 33:56.545
Your ear problem

33:56.625 --> 33:59.065
is definitely from fatigue or stress.

33:59.665 --> 34:00.785
I'm fine now.

34:02.505 --> 34:03.585
I've got meetings today too.

34:03.665 --> 34:05.865
Even I can take a day off.
Why don't you try it?

34:06.465 --> 34:08.264
Take a break.
The world won't stop turning.

34:10.744 --> 34:11.905
Here.

34:11.985 --> 34:13.585
Enjoy.

34:40.025 --> 34:40.865
Chi.

34:42.145 --> 34:43.905
I really need to have
a serious talk with you.

34:45.385 --> 34:46.505
I know what you're gonna say.

34:46.585 --> 34:48.145
I've actually already summed it up myself.

34:48.824 --> 34:51.865
My biggest problem this time
was that I was overconfident.

34:52.385 --> 34:54.744
You kept telling me
to seize the opportunity and act fast.

34:55.425 --> 34:57.385
But I wasn't happy
that the landlord raised the price,

34:57.465 --> 34:59.865
and I wanted to show off
my negotiating skills,

34:59.945 --> 35:01.865
and I forgot to keep an eye
on what was going on outside.

35:01.945 --> 35:03.145
That's what led to all this.

35:08.145 --> 35:08.985
Chi.

35:09.065 --> 35:10.705
I'm your boyfriend,

35:10.785 --> 35:11.705
not your boss.

35:11.785 --> 35:13.225
No need to report every mistake to me.

35:16.065 --> 35:17.825
I know. I'm not.

35:22.065 --> 35:23.665
But good thing
the place didn't go through.

35:24.505 --> 35:26.185
Otherwise, it'd be deemed unsafe,

35:26.705 --> 35:27.945
and your money
would've gone down the drain.

35:28.025 --> 35:29.985
Money doesn't matter at all.

35:30.505 --> 35:32.305
Your health is what matters most.

35:32.385 --> 35:34.705
Your ears are already acting up.
That's life giving you a warning.

35:34.785 --> 35:36.625
You can't keep doing this,
or you're really gonna crash.

35:37.465 --> 35:39.625
But I already promised you
I wouldn't go to work today.

35:40.225 --> 35:41.305
Not just today.

35:41.825 --> 35:43.425
You're too driven.

35:43.505 --> 35:44.745
You want to win at everything.

35:44.825 --> 35:46.905
You're secretly competing with Bu Tianna.

35:47.945 --> 35:49.225
Is it really that hard to accept

35:49.305 --> 35:50.625
that she became project manager first?

35:52.905 --> 35:54.425
Nobody goes through life
without ever failing.

35:54.505 --> 35:57.425
A consultant who's never
gotten used to being surpassed

35:57.945 --> 35:59.225
isn't really a seasoned pro.

36:06.945 --> 36:08.145
But I already failed.

36:09.985 --> 36:12.425
The agent said
an unsafe building can't be sold.

36:12.505 --> 36:15.145
I'll never be able to buy
my mom's apartment back.

36:15.665 --> 36:16.945
How did you fail?

36:17.025 --> 36:19.265
Is that apartment
really that important to you?

36:19.345 --> 36:21.065
Of course it is.

36:21.585 --> 36:23.665
It's the place my mom
always dreamed about.

36:23.745 --> 36:24.985
It's my whole sense of security.

36:26.225 --> 36:27.905
From an outsider's perspective,

36:28.425 --> 36:29.745
that apartment can't give you
security anymore.

36:30.985 --> 36:32.985
Before, whenever something happened,

36:33.065 --> 36:34.665
you'd go hole up in that place.

36:35.745 --> 36:37.905
But recently, during your leave,

36:37.985 --> 36:38.865
you never went there.

36:39.585 --> 36:42.785
And when you got busy,
you'd even forget to call the agent back.

36:43.665 --> 36:44.505
Chi,

36:44.585 --> 36:46.585
is that apartment
really that irreplaceable?

36:47.985 --> 36:49.985
What was your mom's last wish, really?

36:50.665 --> 36:52.145
Did she make you promise
to buy that apartment back?

36:59.985 --> 37:01.385
Before my mom passed,

37:02.545 --> 37:03.545
all she wanted was for me to be okay.

37:05.145 --> 37:06.225
Exactly.

37:07.225 --> 37:09.505
That was a goal you set for yourself,

37:09.585 --> 37:11.985
a shackle you put on yourself.

37:12.745 --> 37:15.505
Your mom would've wanted you
to live happy and healthy

37:15.585 --> 37:16.705
every day,

37:18.185 --> 37:19.385
not worn out like this.

37:21.345 --> 37:23.785
But without that apartment as my goal,

37:25.105 --> 37:27.065
I don't know what the point of my life is.

37:27.945 --> 37:29.105
You tell me not to push so hard,

37:29.185 --> 37:32.265
but if I don't work overtime,
I don't know where to go.

37:40.145 --> 37:41.185
Come with me.

37:50.545 --> 37:52.585
You know why I rented a place here?

37:53.425 --> 37:54.665
Because from here,

37:54.745 --> 37:57.305
you can see the city's bustling CBD.

37:57.385 --> 37:59.585
And it lets you feel
the everyday world too.

38:00.185 --> 38:02.505
Look over there. Those old trees.

38:03.025 --> 38:04.225
When spring comes,

38:04.305 --> 38:07.185
the peach, pear,
and crabapple trees are all in bloom.

38:07.705 --> 38:10.185
Any quick phone snap turns out amazing.

38:11.585 --> 38:14.745
That alley over there
has my favorite barbershop.

38:14.825 --> 38:17.385
The stylist in there talks way too much,

38:17.465 --> 38:18.945
but he's great at actual haircuts.

38:19.705 --> 38:22.065
And by that patch of green over there,

38:22.585 --> 38:25.425
there is a really great baozi shop.

38:25.505 --> 38:26.745
Really juicy.

38:26.825 --> 38:28.265
One bite and it's burning hot,

38:28.345 --> 38:29.625
but so savory.

38:30.425 --> 38:33.385
Chi, have you ever
experienced any of this?

38:39.865 --> 38:41.465
My life…

38:43.585 --> 38:44.985
is basically just

38:45.945 --> 38:48.505
offices, hotels,

38:49.065 --> 38:50.305
office buildings, and airports.

38:50.905 --> 38:51.865
Then I'll show you from now on.

38:53.385 --> 38:54.705
Truth is, there are

38:54.785 --> 38:57.105
so many simple, everyday things in life

38:57.985 --> 38:59.385
that we just need to make
an effort to appreciate.

39:03.585 --> 39:04.865
Forget about that old apartment.

39:07.185 --> 39:08.465
Let me give you
that sense of security. Alright?

39:15.105 --> 39:18.025
I bought it ages ago.
At the jewelry store right next to P&amp;J.

39:18.105 --> 39:19.385
The place we first met.

39:52.985 --> 39:53.825
Will you marry me?

39:56.425 --> 39:57.505
Please don't think

39:58.585 --> 39:59.945
I'm making a move
because you're vulnerable.

40:10.585 --> 40:11.505
I…

40:14.865 --> 40:16.265
I'm really happy.

40:18.345 --> 40:20.745
But I don't think I'm ready yet.

40:28.505 --> 40:29.825
Knew you'd say that.

40:29.905 --> 40:31.225
It's a two-in-one.

40:36.905 --> 40:38.305
You can wear it for now.

40:38.385 --> 40:41.025
Whenever you're ready, just tell me.

40:58.385 --> 40:59.345
It's on.

41:03.105 --> 41:04.145
Do you like it?

41:21.145 --> 41:22.345
Thank you.

41:24.345 --> 41:26.665
I also have myself to thank.

41:28.025 --> 41:30.425
Back at that interview,

41:31.145 --> 41:33.745
I outperformed and moved the heavens…

41:36.305 --> 41:37.745
which is how I got to meet you.

42:21.465 --> 42:23.465
That's the delivery
I completed for Celestial's

42:23.545 --> 42:26.865
four branch offices in the form
of training and workshops. Thank you.

42:37.465 --> 42:39.985
If there are no issues,
that's a wrap for today's meeting.

42:43.265 --> 42:45.425
Miss Xu, thank you.

42:45.505 --> 42:46.505
No worries.

42:48.105 --> 42:49.225
Tianna.

42:50.225 --> 42:52.705
Hope the rest of the delivery goes
as smoothly and efficiently as today's.

42:54.625 --> 42:56.065
Please rest assured. I'll get it done.

42:57.585 --> 42:58.705
By the way,

42:59.265 --> 43:01.025
I've already booked the celebration dinner

43:01.105 --> 43:02.145
for after the project wraps next week.

43:02.225 --> 43:03.665
Everyone's been eating
at the Celestial cafeteria for so long.

43:03.745 --> 43:05.185
I figured you'd want a change of pace.

43:05.265 --> 43:06.625
Then I'm bringing
two good bottles of wine.

43:11.105 --> 43:13.185
So? Are you holding up okay?

43:13.265 --> 43:15.025
I'm in perfect shape.

43:18.665 --> 43:19.905
Oh my.

43:25.985 --> 43:26.825
Let's go.

43:27.465 --> 43:28.545
Hold on.

43:31.705 --> 43:33.305
My nanny made this nourishing soup.

43:33.385 --> 43:34.905
I drove home just to get it.

43:34.985 --> 43:36.985
You're drinking all of it.
Not a single drop left.

43:38.265 --> 43:39.785
You drove home just to get it?

43:39.865 --> 43:41.825
That's a whole production.

43:41.905 --> 43:43.945
See, I'm totally fine now. I'm good.

43:45.345 --> 43:46.825
It is pretty good.

43:47.425 --> 43:48.345
Let's go.
